{"id":"a57cead6abc35383","group":"91","path":"91/91-thm-positive-induction-adequacy.md","title":"标准 KF 中正公式的统一去引号与归纳","display":"thm-positive-induction-adequacy — 标准 KF 中正公式的统一去引号与归纳","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-thm-positive-induction-adequacy","aliases":["91-thm-positive-induction-adequacy","91-thm-positive-induction","91-thm-KF-induction"],"display":"thm-positive-induction-adequacy — 标准 KF 中正公式的统一去引号与归纳","depends_on":["[[91-df-positive-formula]]","[[91-df-KF]]","[[91-df-induction-schema]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-thm-positive-induction-adequacy"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-thm-positive-induction-adequacy</span><span>91-thm-positive-induction</span><span>91-thm-KF-induction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-positive-induction-adequacy — 标准 KF 中正公式的统一去引号与归纳"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e4ff0dbf2ccbb847\" href=\"?note=e4ff0dbf2ccbb847\" title=\"91-df-positive-formula\">91-df-positive-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a0a2284f96eaea1d\" href=\"?note=a0a2284f96eaea1d\" title=\"91-df-KF\">91-df-KF</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"09791de618b277ba\" href=\"?note=09791de618b277ba\" title=\"91-df-induction-schema\">91-df-induction-schema</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi(\\vec x)\\in\\mathrm{PosFml}_T\">\\(\\varphi(\\vec x)\\in\\mathrm{PosFml}_T\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KF}\">\\(\\mathrm{KF}\\)</span> 为包含全 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ind}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{Ind}_T\\)</span> 的版本；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SubTm}_{\\vec x}\">\\(\\operatorname{SubTm}_{\\vec x}\\)</span>、闭项量词与求值采用共享编码约定。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}positive\\text{-}induction\\text{-}adequacy}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{KF}\\vdash\\forall\\vec t\\,\n[T(\\operatorname{SubTm}_{\\vec x}(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner},\\vec t))\\leftrightarrow\\varphi(\\operatorname{val}(\\vec t))].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}positive\\text{-}induction\\text{-}adequacy}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{KF}\\vdash\\forall\\vec t\\,\n[T(\\operatorname{SubTm}_{\\vec x}(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner},\\vec t))\\leftrightarrow\\varphi(\\operatorname{val}(\\vec t))].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathrm{PosFml}_T}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ind}_T\\subseteq\\mathrm{KF}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathrm{PosFml}_T}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ind}_T\\subseteq\\mathrm{KF}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>第一行是原书 Lemma 15.4，以矩阵结构归纳及十三条公理证明。第二行由标准 KF 的完整归纳直接包含正公式归纳实例。\n此处不再以未指明的“某个 KF 正归纳版本已证明全局反射”作定理前提；不同弱归纳版本的精确最小强度未由原文件给出，也不是上述结论的推论。标准全归纳 KF 证明 PA 一致性另见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a295446296ee06c0\" href=\"?note=a295446296ee06c0\" title=\"91-thm-KF-proves-PA-consistency\">91-thm-KF-proves-PA-consistency</a>。</p>\n<p>来源：Lemma 15.4 与 Definition 15.2，印刷页 186–187；弱归纳版本的最小强度不作未证断言。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-positive-formula","status":"resolved",